<title>UK: Commerzbank sets warrants on German blue chips.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank sets warrants on German blue chips.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerzbank said it has issued 160 million American-style call and put warrants in 16 equal tranches, on four German blue chips.</p>
<p>There are five tranches on BASF, two tranches on Dresdner Bank, five tranches on Hoechst and four tranches on Schering.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p>COMMOM TERMS:</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 14.NOV.96-18.MAR.98   PAYDATE	07.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FRANKFURT, DUSSELDORF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
